  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/12779_free-nursing-home.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Fan Jinlin, a young man from Henan, was born in 1997. He is now the director of four nursing homes and is also the director of the nursing home with the most fans in China. After graduating from college, he opened his first nursing home with the support of his family. An accidental opportunity made him change his mind and decided to make his nursing home free. An old man once expressed to Fan Jinlin that he hoped to live in a nursing home for a long time and that the cost could be cheaper. The old man was also willing to do other things for the nursing home and Fan Jinlin. This request made Fan Jinlin consider starting a free nursing home. He plans to invest 1.2 million yuan to let the elderly live for free, but the elderly here need to shoot some videos to turn the free nursing home into an Internet celebrity nursing home. The income from these videos can help the operation of the nursing home. Fan Jinlin also prepared a video game room for the elderly, because many elderly people really want to learn about young people's things. He believes that nursing homes should also be full of energy and laughter."
  ],
  "english_full": "Fan Jinlin, a young man from Henan, was born in 1997. He is now the director of four nursing homes and is also the director of the nursing home with the most fans in China. After graduating from college, he opened his first nursing home with the support of his family. An accidental opportunity made him change his mind and decided to make his nursing home free. An old man once expressed to Fan Jinlin that he hoped to live in a nursing home for a long time and that the cost could be cheaper. The old man was also willing to do other things for the nursing home and Fan Jinlin. This request made Fan Jinlin consider starting a free nursing home. He plans to invest 1.2 million yuan to let the elderly live for free, but the elderly here need to shoot some videos to turn the free nursing home into an Internet celebrity nursing home. The income from these videos can help the operation of the nursing home. Fan Jinlin also prepared a video game room for the elderly, because many elderly people really want to learn about young people's things. He believes that nursing homes should also be full of energy and laughter.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Фан Цзиньлинь, молодо́й челове́к из Хэна́нь, роди́лся в 1997 году. Се́йчас он дире́ктор четырех домо́в престаре́лых, а также дире́ктор дома престаре́лых с наибольши́м числом ве́рных боле́льщиков в Кита́е. По́сле вы́пуска из ко́лледжа он открыл свой пер́вый дом престаре́лых с подде́ржкой своей семьи́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Fan Цзиньлинь, моло́дой челове́к из Хэна́нь, роди́лся в 1997 году. Се́йчас он дире́ктор че́тырых домо́в престаре́лых, а также дире́ктор дома престаре́лых с наибо́льшим числом ве́рных боле́льщиков в Кита́е. По́сле вы́пуска из ко́лледжа он открыл свой пе́рвый дом престаре́лых с подде́ржкой свое́й семьи́."
  ],
